  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 6 plus StartRoot x EndRoot\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 36 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>",
